- `start_mac_and_dma()` in [sg2000_eth.c](vendor/sg2000/chips/sg2000/sg2000_eth.c), especially the `DMA_CONTROL_ST`/`DMA_CONTROL_SR` sequence;
- `netdriver_ifup()` in [sg2000_eth.c](vendor/sg2000/chips/sg2000/sg2000_eth.c), especially the unconditional `rx_doorbell()` call after startup;
