Adjust the low-level transmit helper so it can send raw bytes without requiring a `netpkt_t`. Keep it responsible for:
- checking descriptor ownership;
- copying the frame into the TX DMA buffer;
- cleaning the TX buffer cache range;
- filling the descriptor;
- cleaning the descriptor cache range;
- advancing `tx_cur`;
- ringing TX doorbell.

